flowchart TD
    Q["Build queue<br/>Redis / file / Kafka"] -->|Lease batch| MATCH["Match plan DAG to build rows<br/>resolve runtime + pack digests"]
    MATCH --> PREFETCH["Fetch or build packs and runtimes<br/>extract CAS tarballs<br/>mount DEPS_PREFIXES"]
    PREFETCH --> PODMAN["Runner using Podman<br/>mount /output /cache<br/>inputs via object store<br/>pass JOB_* envs"]
    PODMAN --> CMD["Run WORKER_RUN_CMD<br/>default pip wheel build in builder image"]
    CMD --> LOGS["Structured log stream<br/>attempt status / reason / evidence"]
    CMD --> CHECK{{Succeeded?}}
    CHECK -->|Yes| STORE["Publish wheel runtime pack repair<br/>CAS + object store"]
    CHECK -->|No| RETRY["Apply known hint / heuristic / LLM recipes<br/>bounded attempts"]
    RETRY --> PODMAN
    STORE --> MANIFEST[Write manifest + artifact metadata]
    MANIFEST --> REPORT[Post status attempts events\nand worker heartbeats to control-plane]
    LOGS --> REPORT
    RETRY -. if max retries fail .-> REPORT
